{"id":"en_code-queen","title":"Code Queen","titleEn":"Code Queen","description":"Na de verdachte dood van haar dochter, een programmeur, ontdekt de 67-jarige Margaret dat haar algoritme door haar echtgenoot en een technologiemagnaat is gestolen. Ze leert van nul af aan programmeren en volgt de laatste code van haar dochter om de waarheid aan het licht te brengen en gerechtigheid te zoeken. Bij Dramzio zijn de serie en de afzonderlijke afleveringen te volgen.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/code-queen/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/code-queen/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Car Accident","Family Love","Female","Genius","Growth","Independent Woman"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0c2o/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_code-queen_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0c2o/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_code-queen_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0c2o/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_code-queen_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0c2o/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_code-queen_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0c2o/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_code-queen_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0c2o/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":